  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 337cd45af68470a439cb8beeb02f9225, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  textLines:
  - You already know how this ends, Milly.
  - 
  - Still smiling. Still pretending.
  - "Your thoughts, your fear \u2014 they\u2019re not yours.\r\n"
  - Just meat... reacting.
  - "You\u2019ve done this before. Again. Again. Again."
  - "Every time, you hope it\u2019s a dream."
  - "But this time\u2026"
  - "\u2026someone is watching."
  textDuration: 4
  isHint: 0
